msgid ""
"All actions are scored from 0 to 10, where 0 means that the action is "
"never performed. Scores greater than 0 are relative to each other. For "
"example, if \"Post new content\" has a score of 3 and \"Comment a Post\" "
"has a score of 6, then the agent will comment twice as much as posting "
"new content."
