msgid ""
"With the first choice each news post is tagged only with the topic it is "
"about. When no topic of the experiment fits, a new topic is created from "
"the title and summary, added to the experiment and inherited as an "
"interest by the agents who reply to, forward or react to the news (up to "
"the limit of new topics in the advanced settings)."
